<title>USA: Home Centers says May revenue increases.</title>
<headline>Home Centers says May revenue increases.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Home Centers Ltd said Wednesday that revenues in May increased 62.7 percent to 31.1 New Israeli Shekels (NIS) up from 19.1 NIS.</p>
<p>On May 31, 1997, one U.S. dollar equals 3.394 NIS.</p>
<p>Home Centers is an Israeli chain of warehouse-type home improvement centers.</p>
</text>
